body:
I am using verion v12.1.6

I am following the [multi-tenant](https://vercel.com/guides/nextjs-multi-tenant-application) the issue is that when I implement the shallow push the page doesn't  reload as expected but in the URL it writes the URL rewrite with the subdomain query also.


```
 router.push(
            {
              query: {
                site: router.query.site,
                id: router.query.id,
                start_date: "12-12-2022",
              },
            },
            undefined,
            {
              shallow: true,
            }
          );
```


Original URL :`http://casablanca.nomadtest.com:3001/room/0e161feb-89ae-4373-a3f1-55ac5eed9027`

Shallow push URL: `http://casablanca.nomadtest.com:3001/_sites/casablanca/room/0e161feb-89ae-4373-a3f1-55ac5eed9027? start_date: "12-12-2022`

As you can see it adds the "_sites/casablanca/" in the URL.

Dont know if this is an issue because I working on localhost ?

@BowlingX  Hi I just try with version 12.1.0  and in this version it breaks 

Original URL: `http://casablanca.nomadtest.com:3001/room/0e161feb-89ae-4373-a3f1-55ac5eed9027`

Shallow push URL: `http://casablanca.nomadtest.com:3001/_sites/casablanca/room/0e161feb-89ae-4373-a3f1-55ac5eed9027?start_date=12-12-2022`

In this version this provoke a refresh resulting in 404 

So I guess v12.1.6 somehow works it just writes the wrong URL while using NextResponse.rewrite(url) in the middleware

Here is the middleware from the multu-tenat example

```
export default function middleware(req: NextRequest) {
  const url = req.nextUrl.clone();
  const { pathname } = req.nextUrl;
  const hostname = req.headers.get("host");
  const currentHost = hostname!.replace(`.nomadtest.com:3001`, "");

  if (pathname.startsWith(`/_sites`)) {
    return new Response(null, { status: 404 });
  }

  if (!pathname.includes(".") && !pathname.startsWith("/api")) {
    if (currentHost === "host") {
      url.pathname = `/host${pathname}`;
      return NextResponse.rewrite(url);
    } else if (hostname === "nomadtest.com:3001") {
      return NextResponse.rewrite(url);
    } else {
      url.pathname = `/_sites/${currentHost}${pathname}`;
      return NextResponse.rewrite(url);
    }
  }
  return NextResponse.rewrite(url);
}
```
